+\[
+ \delta=e^{32\pi d\xi}-1,\qquad
+ \eta=e^{32\pi(d+\ell-2)\xi}-1.                     \tag{A25}
+\]
+For a local polynomial P whose conditional Haar average E_H P is zero,
