+\[
+ a_Y=q_{\mathcal A+\kappa}(Y),\quad c_Y=\langle Y,W\rangle_\rho,
+ \quad \alpha_Y=c_Y/a_Y,\quad
+ R_{\rm can}=W-(D+\kappa)(\alpha_Y Y).
